        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Elon, this really doesn’t make sense… Why would equipment makers build custom tools specifically for Terafab? They can simply keep selling the tools they already make to Intel, TSMC, and Samsung. Why would they spend extra on R&D to develop tools exclusively for Terafab?  If",
