          "timestamp": "2026-10-11T08:22:24.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 427
        },
        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Daishin Securities (Korea): Discussions on mass-producing lower-stack HBM (4-high/6-high) have effectively been called off. The shift from 12-high to 8-high has also been scaled back.",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2109142036448465111",
          "timestamp": "2026-10-11T12:40:22.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 229
        },
        {
          "handle": "tphuang",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "CXMT expects to unveil DDR5 RDIMM product @ end of this yr that will use 4F² & other tech.   Going 6F² → 4F² cuts cell area by 33% at the same F, so huge shrink. Cell transistors must be rebuilt. 融合4F² -> 4F²-derived layout or partial implementation on G5-class silicon rather",
          "url": "https://x.com/tphuang/status/2108891225558261800",
          "timestamp": "2026-10-10T20:03:44.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 133
        },
        {
          "handle": "tphuang",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Based on what Samsung has shown in its beyond 10nm timeline, CXMT's VSG/Vertical Surrounded Gate transistor here is akin to Samsung's VCT planned for around 2030.  It seems like the 1st step toward fully 3D DRAM. I'd expect CXMT to be using IGZO channel material here.  I know",
          "url": "https://x.com/tphuang/status/2109011253502845203",
          "timestamp": "2026-10-11T04:00:41.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 116
        },
        {
          "handle": "ctee.fans",
          "platform": "Facebook",
          "text": "AI資料中心投資持續擴大，全球科技巨頭為確保晶片供應，紛紛與供應商簽署長期供應協議(LTA)，據韓國經濟日報報導，輝達、谷歌、微軟等科技巨頭已與三星電子簽署期限超過5年的晶片供應協議，三星明年約80％的記憶體產能已透過長約鎖定買家。…… \n查看更多",
          "url": "",
